      "id": "2053138453681057953",
      "text": "RT @XFreeze: Noland Arbaugh’s life has been completely transformed\n\n“I can control a computer with my thoughts”\n\nAs the first human to rece…",
      "created_at": "Sat May 09 15:42:07 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
